  "basis": "Synthetic. Built from this tool's reading of Da Vinci DTR and SDC. It has not been observed from the live service.",
  "assumption": "How the live service answers when its rules need no documentation is not known. This file models a first next-question call that returns the QuestionnaireResponse with the status completed and a contained questionnaire that holds no question. The marker is the boolean form, which DTR 2.0.1 allows and later versions do not. The questionnaire inside each response carries the url of the one in the package and no derivedFrom, which is not how the guides tie the two: this tool then ties them by that url.",
